@startuml SEQ_03_MELIHAT_HASIL_KUESIONER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-03: Melihat Hasil Kuesioner

actor       "Admin / Kadep"       as User
boundary    "KuesionerPage"       as Page
control     "KuesionerController" as Ctrl
entity      "Kuesioner"           as ModelKuesioner
entity      "ResponKuesioner"     as ModelRespon

== Lihat Daftar Kuesioner ==

User -> Page             : Buka menu Hasil Kuesioner

Page -> Ctrl             : GET /kuesioner/hasil

Ctrl -> ModelKuesioner   : Query daftar kuesioner
ModelKuesioner --> Ctrl  : Data kuesioner
Ctrl --> Page            : Render halaman hasil kuesioner
Page --> User            : Tampil daftar kuesioner

== Lihat Rekap Hasil Kuesioner ==

User -> Page             : Pilih salah satu kuesioner

Page -> Ctrl             : GET /kuesioner/{id}/hasil

Ctrl -> ModelRespon      : Query rekap hasil per kuesioner
ModelRespon --> Ctrl     : Data rekap hasil
Ctrl --> Page            : Render rekap hasil
Page --> User            : Tampil hasil kuesioner

@enduml